            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick an enemy Hero in combat with this unit to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">If the unmodified casting roll exceeds the target&apos;s Health characteristic, it is automatically destroyed. For the rest of the battle, that unit cannot be picked to be the target of an ability that allows a replacement unit to be set up.</characteristic>
