            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a friendly **^^Slaves to Darkness Hero^^** within this unit&apos;s combat range to be this unit&apos;s master.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">For the rest of the battle, while this unit is within its master&apos;s combat range:
