            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If this unit charged this phase and the unmodified charge roll was 8+, add 1 to the Rend characteristic of this unit&apos;s weapons for the rest of the battle.</characteristic>
