            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">This unit can use 2 **^^Fight^^** abilities this phase. After the first is used, however, this unit has **^^Strike-last^^** for the rest of the turn. When using the second **^^Fight^^** ability, this unit must pick an enemy **^^Hero^^** to be the target of all of its attacks.</characteristic>
