                        <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Your Hero Phase</characteristic>
                        <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"/>
                        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">This unit must use this ability in each of your hero phases. Roll a dice and apply the corresponding effect until the start of your next turn:
**1 *Rotting Skin:*** Inflict 1 mortal damage on this unit. Subtract 1 from the control scores of enemy units while they are within 12&quot; of this unit.
**2 *Brittle Scales:*** Add 1 to the Rend characteristic of combat attacks that target this unit.
**3 *Bestial Tongue:*** You lose 1 command point. This unit cannot use commands.
**4 *Sprouting Tentacles:*** This unit&apos;s Move characteristic is 2D6&quot;.
**5 *Extra Eyeball:*** Add 1 to hit rolls for this unit&apos;s combat attacks.
**6 *Erupting Spikes:*** Each time this unit finishes a pile-in move, pick an enemy unit within 1&quot; of this unit to be the target. Inflict D3 mortal damage on the target.</characteristic>
                        <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
                        <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
                </selectionEntry>
